{'symbol': 'NWS', 'date': '2022-06-08 16:30:00', 'title': "NEWS CORP'S DOW JONES TO PARTICIPATE IN THE CREDIT SUISSE 24TH ANNUAL COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE", 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NEWS CORP ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF DOW JONES AND PUBLISHER OF THE WALL STREET JOURNAL ALMAR LATOUR WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE CREDIT SUISSE 24TH ANNUAL COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 15, 2022. THE VIRTUAL SESSION WILL BEGIN AT 9:30AM ET. TO LISTEN TO THE LIVE WEBCAST, PLEASE VISIT THE NEWS CORP WEBSITE AT HTTPS://INVESTORS.NEWSCORP.COM/CALENDAR-EVENTS. A REPLAY OF THE WEBCAST IS EXPECTED TO BE AVAILABLE AT THE SAME LOCATION FOR A PERI'}